# Original fictional watershed-monitoring corpus for operational trials.
requirement OPS-ALERT-001
title: Alert operators to hazards
statement:
  The monitoring service shall alert operators when observed watershed conditions indicate a configured hazard.
rationale:
  Timely warning supports evacuation and field-response decisions.
end requirement

requirement SYS-ALERT-DETECT-001
title: Detect hazard thresholds
statement:
  The service shall detect a hazard when a qualified measurement crosses its configured threshold.
decomposes: OPS-ALERT-001
end requirement

requirement EDGE-THRESHOLD-001
title: Evaluate local thresholds
statement:
  The station processor shall evaluate each qualified measurement against locally stored hazard thresholds.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-DETECT-001
end requirement

requirement SERVER-THRESHOLD-001
title: Evaluate watershed thresholds
statement:
  The central service shall evaluate configured combinations of measurements from multiple stations.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-DETECT-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-ALERT-CLASSIFY-001
title: Classify detected hazards
statement:
  The service shall assign each detected hazard a configured severity and affected watershed area.
decomposes: OPS-ALERT-001
end requirement

requirement SERVER-SEVERITY-001
title: Assign hazard severity
statement:
  The alert processor shall assign severity using the rule that detected the hazard.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-CLASSIFY-001
end requirement

requirement SERVER-AREA-001
title: Identify affected area
statement:
  The alert processor shall associate each hazard with every configured area affected by its source stations.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-CLASSIFY-001
end requirement

requirement SYS-ALERT-NOTIFY-001
title: Notify designated operators
statement:
  The service shall issue an initial operator notification within 60 seconds after detecting a hazard and escalate unacknowledged notifications according to configured time bounds.
decomposes: OPS-ALERT-001
end requirement

requirement NOTIFY-PRIMARY-001
title: Send primary notification
statement:
  The notification service shall send each hazard notification through the configured primary channel.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-NOTIFY-001
end requirement

requirement NOTIFY-ESCALATE-001
title: Escalate unacknowledged hazards
statement:
  The notification service shall use the configured escalation channel when a hazard remains unacknowledged for five minutes.
decomposes: SYS-ALERT-NOTIFY-001
end requirement
